Subtask 3.2: Test User Authentication
Test IdM user login to Satellite:

Logout from Satellite web interface
Login using testuser1 credentials
Verify access to appropriate resources
Verify user permissions:

# From Satellite server
hammer user list
hammer user info --login testuser1
Test command line authentication:
# Test API access with IdM credentials
curl -u testuser1:password -k \
  https://satellite.example.com/api/v2/hosts
Subtask 3.3: Provision a New System
Create a new host via Satellite web interface:

Navigate to Hosts → Create Host
Name: newclient.example.com
Host Group: RHEL8-IdM-Integrated
Deploy on: Bare Metal (simulated)
Configure provisioning parameters:

# Host Configuration:
# Organization: Default Organization
# Location: Default Location
# Host Group: RHEL8-IdM-Integrated
# Compute Resource: None (bare metal)
# Provisioning Method: Network Based
Generate provisioning script:
# From Satellite server
hammer host create \
  --name="newclient.example.com" \
  --hostgroup="RHEL8-IdM-Integrated" \
  --organization="Default Organization" \
  --location="Default Location" \
  --build=true
Subtask 3.4: Verify Automated IdM Integration
Check that new hosts automatically join IdM:
# On IdM server
kinit admin
ipa host-find
Verify host certificates:
# Check for host certificates in IdM
ipa cert-find --subject="CN=newclient.example.com"
Test remote execution on managed hosts:
# From Satellite web interface or CLI
hammer job-invocation create \
  --job-template="Run Command - SSH Default" \
  --inputs="command=hostname" \
  --search-query="name ~ client"
Subtask 3.5: Monitor and Validate Integration
Check Satellite logs for IdM integration:
tail -f /var/log/foreman/production.log | grep -i ldap
Verify IdM authentication logs:
# On IdM server
tail -f /var/log/dirsrv/slapd-EXAMPLE-COM/access
Test complete workflow:
# Create a test job template
hammer job-template create \
  --name="IdM Status Check" \
  --job-category="Commands" \
  --provider-type="SSH" \
  --template='ipa-client-install --uninstall --unattended; echo "IdM client status checked"'
Execute the job on managed hosts:
hammer job-invocation create \
  --job-template="IdM Status Check" \
  --search-query="hostgroup = RHEL8-IdM-Integrated"
Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: LDAP Connection Failures
Symptoms: Users cannot authenticate via IdM Solution:

# Check LDAP connectivity
ldapsearch -x -H ldaps://idm.example.com:636 -b "dc=example,dc=com"

# Verify certificates
openssl s_client -connect idm.example.com:636 -showcerts

# Check firewall rules
firewall-cmd --list-all
Issue 2: Host Registration Problems
Symptoms: Clients cannot register with Satellite Solution:

# Clean previous registrations
subscription-manager clean

# Check Satellite connectivity
curl -k https://satellite.example.com/rhsm/status

# Verify activation key
hammer activation-key list
Issue 3: Remote Execution Failures
Symptoms: Jobs fail to execute on remote hosts Solution:

# Check SSH connectivity
sudo -u foreman ssh root@client1.example.com

# Verify SSH keys
ls -la /usr/share/foreman/.ssh/

# Check remote execution settings
hammer settings list | grep remote_execution
Validation and Testing
Comprehensive Integration Test
Create a test script to validate the complete integration:
#!/bin/bash
# integration_test.sh

echo "Testing IdM-Satellite Integration..."

# Test 1: LDAP Authentication
echo "1. Testing LDAP authentication..."
ldapsearch -x -H ldaps://idm.example.com:636 \
  -D "uid=satellite-service,cn=users,cn=accounts,dc=example,dc=com" \
  -W -b "cn=users,cn=accounts,dc=example,dc=com" \
  "(uid=testuser1)" | grep -q "testuser1"

if [ $? -eq 0 ]; then
    echo "   ✓ LDAP authentication working"
else
    echo "   ✗ LDAP authentication failed"
fi

# Test 2: Host Registration
echo "2. Testing host registration..."
subscription-manager status | grep -q "Overall Status: Current"

if [ $? -eq 0 ]; then
    echo "   ✓ Host registration successful"
else
    echo "   ✗ Host registration failed"
fi

# Test 3: Remote Execution
echo "3. Testing remote execution..."
hammer job-invocation create \
  --job-template="Run Command - SSH Default" \
  --inputs="command=echo 'Integration test successful'" \
  --search-query="name = $(hostname)" \
  --async

echo "Integration test completed."
Run the validation script:
chmod +x integration_test.sh
./integration_test.sh
